  "story": {
    "title": "Kichik hikoya",
    "text": "It is sunny outside now, and I stay here with my sister. She says, 'You love the yellow car.' I say, 'Does he like the car too?' She says, 'Sometimes people ask, what is her name?' I say, 'Her name is Jessica.' Sometimes she stays outside, but now she is here with me. He drives the black car every day. He is happy with the car.",
